<title>NEW ZEALAND: Capital Group lowers stake in Telecom.</title>
<headline>Capital Group lowers stake in Telecom.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Capital Group of Companies said in a substantial security holder's notice to the New Zealand Stock Exchange on Thursday that it had lowered its relevant interest in Telecom Corp of New Zealand to 7.43 percent from 8.48 percent.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473-4746</p>
</text>
